<title>POLAND: Remak expects sharp rise in 1997 profit.</title>
<headline>Remak expects sharp rise in 1997 profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish engineering company Remak SA expects its 1997 net profit to rise to 987,000 zlotys from 100,000 zlotys last year, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Remak said its sales should rise to 81.7 million from 75.5 million zlotys last year.</p>
